        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Polygon War</strong> is a <strong>strategy</strong>, <strong>idle</strong> and <strong>roguelike</strong> game. You choose a <strong>turret</strong>, select a <strong>weapon</strong>, and dive into a series of increasingly difficult enemy waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The turret <strong>fires automatically</strong>, allowing you to focus on resource management. Spend the coins earned from each wave wisely in the in-game shop to survive the next wave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game  features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>16</strong> <strong>turrets</strong> with <strong>different abilities and stats.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793840/extras/f45cbfea1d40f301956d395cfc33b34c.avif?t=1754823902\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793840/extras_big/f45cbfea1d40f301956d395cfc33b34c.webp?t=1754823902 width=1600 height=420 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>17 unique bullets.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793840/extras/59a62981b3bda53e18ff15233b2cec1a.avif?t=1754823902\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793840/extras_big/59a62981b3bda53e18ff15233b2cec1a.webp?t=1754823902 width=1600 height=414 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 challenging difficulty modes</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793840/extras/85bfa986b185db2ce6489d318181314d.avif?t=1754823902\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793840/extras_big/85bfa986b185db2ce6489d318181314d.webp?t=1754823902 width=1600 height=146 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you think you can survive the most rounds in Infinite Mode on the highest difficulty, give it a try. If you fall short, the <strong>record system</strong> will track the highest difficulty you've beaten and the most rounds completed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793840/extras/48f384d67e60794db10e77f53cb2e9dd.poster.avif?t=1754823902\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793840/extras/48f384d67e60794db10e77f53cb2e9dd.webm?t=1754823902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793840/extras/48f384d67e60794db10e77f53cb2e9dd.mp4?t=1754823902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Polygon War</strong> is a <strong>strategy</strong>, <strong>idle</strong> and <strong>roguelike</strong> game. You choose a <strong>turret</strong>, select a <strong>weapon</strong>, and dive into a series of increasingly difficult enemy waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The turret <strong>fires automatically</strong>, allowing you to focus on resource management. Spend the coins earned from each wave wisely in the in-game shop to survive the next wave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game  features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>16</strong> <strong>turrets</strong> with <strong>different abilities and stats.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793840/extras/f45cbfea1d40f301956d395cfc33b34c.avif?t=1754823902\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793840/extras_big/f45cbfea1d40f301956d395cfc33b34c.webp?t=1754823902 width=1600 height=420 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>17 unique bullets.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793840/extras/59a62981b3bda53e18ff15233b2cec1a.avif?t=1754823902\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793840/extras_big/59a62981b3bda53e18ff15233b2cec1a.webp?t=1754823902 width=1600 height=414 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 challenging difficulty modes</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >